      "date": "2026-11-03T17:15:19Z"
     },
     "message": "Clarify which hosts use GH_ENTERPRISE_TOKEN\n\n`gh help environment` said the enterprise tokens apply to GitHub\nEnterprise Server hosts, but not how `gh` decides a host is one. go-gh\nuses GH_TOKEN and GITHUB_TOKEN for github.com, subdomains of ghe.com,\nand github.localhost, and the enterprise tokens for every other host:\nhttps://github.com/cli/go-gh/blob/v2.17.0/pkg/auth/auth.go#L63-L84\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot App <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>",
